      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMER RUSSELL (1) was an impressive winner last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by half a length (27.58) at this track. Looks well placed and should be tough to beat. SPEEDY DEVILLE (2) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on her solid win the start prior, getting around this track over 300m in 17.17. Top win two back and can measure up again. MY BOY BEAST (3) was in the minors when resuming at this track where he finished second (17.09) in a Free For All. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Winning chance. ZARA'S SECRET (7) is last start winner who looks one of the chances.",
